sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant GuestRoute
    participant AuthContext
    participant Axios
    participant Middleware
    participant Java as AuthService

    User->>GuestRoute: GET /login (?reason=session_expired, ?email=)
    GuestRoute->>AuthContext: loading while refresh()
    AuthContext->>AuthContext: shouldSkipInitialSessionProbe()?
    alt guest page and no tokens
        AuthContext-->>GuestRoute: user=null, skip /auth/me
        GuestRoute-->>User: render Login.tsx
    else has co_refresh or access metadata
        AuthContext->>Axios: ensureFreshSession → POST /auth/refresh
        Axios->>Middleware: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh
        Middleware->>Java: POST /auth/refresh (HMAC)
        Java-->>Middleware: new access + refresh
        Middleware-->>Axios: Set-Cookie co_session, co_refresh
        AuthContext->>Axios: GET /auth/me
        Middleware->>Java: GET /auth/me
        Java-->>AuthContext: user DTO
        GuestRoute->>GuestRoute: user present → Navigate
        alt user.onboarded
            GuestRoute-->>User: redirect /dashboard or state.from
        else not onboarded
            GuestRoute-->>User: redirect /onboarding
        end
    end
